  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "⭐ Last 10 features:\n- feat: Improve CLI generation. 2025-06-25\n- feat(SG): Added CLI generation to source generators. 2025-06-25\n- feat(cli): Add ability to generate CLIs for client. 2025-06-24\n- feat(cli): Updated System.CommandLine. 2025-06-24\n- feat: Also wrap JSON deserialization exception from error responses. 2025-06-18\n- feat(debug): Now JSON deserialization exceptions will be more clear. 2025-06-18\n- feat: Ignore OpenAPI errors by default. 2025-06-05\n- feat(Source Generators): Added parallel client generation. 2025-06-05\n- feat: Now Enum converter will handle JsonTokenType.Null 2025-05-13\n- feat: Add support for visual studio 2025-05-09\n🐞 Last 10 bug fixes:\n- fix(cli): Fixed x-cli-action metadata. 2025-06-24\n- fix(cli): Allow to specify CLiAction for CLI generation. 2025-06-24\n- fix(cli): Simplified command names for CLI 2025-06-24\n- fix(cli): Fixed some warnings in generated code for CLI 2025-06-24\n- fix: Fixed deprecation warning for AnyOf/OneOf/AllOf types. 2025-06-18\n- fix: Fixed ElevenLabs specific bug. 2025-06-18\n- fix: Fixed deprecated message for generated methods. 2025-06-17\n- fix: Fixed missed serialization of complex query parameters. 2025-06-17\n- fix: Add AutoSDK_Namespace and ClassName metadata 2025-06-05\n- fix: Fixed deepinfra.json issues 2025-05-16",
